# Step 17 — Associate Route Table with Subnet

VERY IMPORTANT.

Issue faced:

* Route table was NOT associated with subnet.
* Traffic never entered VPN tunnel.
* Ping failed.

Fix:

```text
Route Table
→ Subnet Associations
→ Edit subnet associations
→ Select Aravind-Subnet
→ Save
```

This fixed VPN routing.

